{"id":2723,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>为喜迎中北大学建校85周年，进一步凝聚爱校共识、激励学子与母校同奋进共成长，5月13日下午，我院在科艺苑学术报告厅举办校庆主题活动，由学生代表吴媛汇报，研一研二学生参加。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WM8CHiMRUPozN8Ug8CanRNaMNlinzGL8o77ZnzGPU4TkUNL0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yiUYhfM1hRUl7PozUDozC4Ul-bLlL8L49iolLPL4QVLNnFoz67U4M7MRMFLm7bL7lJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CbozlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6995&e=.jpg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/25CA6CAA1946963AB91C43859C136E2D/97DC3D43/2190E\" vheight=\"255.52000427246094\" vwidth=\"339.989990234375\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WM8CHiMRUPozN8Ug8CanRNaMNlinzGL8o77ZnzGPU4TkUNL0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yiUYhfM1hRUl7PozUDozC4Ul-bLlL8L49iolLPL4QVLNnFoz67U4M7MRMFLm7bL7lJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CbozlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6995&e=.jpg\"></p><p>吴媛同学回顾了学校近年来在学科建设、科研平台建设等方面的亮眼成就，并重点阐述了学院的思想引领、实践赋能、服务保障全方位育人体系。她谈到，依托学院优质培育资源，自己在理论学习、社会实践中不断收获成长，真切体会到与母校同奋进、共成长的收获与自豪。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Woz6Hfnz7YozLang7r2M7lYnlLYLmCLiU8rkUN7DLm6kn770gihFp2hmCIa0nSy8UYh7n1y8M4vZn7VfUmNPM4vbnRLbMzLao7LsUm7anlQFoRr2UN7iL8nFLmU8nlCJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CbozlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6995&e=.jpg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E4CDF4778DAAB91779D395308C7B10EF/85FBA53D/244EF\" vheight=\"217.3300018310547\" vwidth=\"339.989990234375\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Woz6Hfnz7YozLang7r2M7lYnlLYLmCLiU8rkUN7DLm6kn770gihFp2hmCIa0nSy8UYh7n1y8M4vZn7VfUmNPM4vbnRLbMzLao7LsUm7anlQFoRr2UN7iL8nFLmU8nlCJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CbozlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6995&e=.jpg\"></p><p>八十五载薪火相传，初心不改再启新程。全体马院学子将传承中北红色军工精神，潜心治学、躬身实践，以青春之力感恩母校栽培，助力学校在新时代续写华章。</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WM8CHiMRUPozN8Ug8CanRNaMNlinzGL8o77ZnzGPU4TkUNL0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yiUYhfM1hRUl7PozUDozC4Ul-bLlL8L49iolLPL4QVLNnFoz67U4M7MRMFLm7bL7lJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CbozlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6995&e=.jpg"}